#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:5 ecded71e3dc24322bf69469b1f5a370d
msgid "ROS 2 on Raspberry Pi"
msgstr "在 Raspberry Pi 上使用 ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:7 2c9e1601f17248d4821a648e88145a52
msgid ""
"ROS2 (via DDS) is not part of the standard ArduPilot build. Use the `Custom "
"Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ and ensure "
"\"MicroXRCE DDS support for ROS 2\" is checked."
msgstr ""
"ROS 2（通过 DDS）不属于 ArduPilot 标准构建的一部分。请使用 `自定义构建服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ 并确保勾选「MicroXRCE DDS support for "
"ROS 2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:10 5ff18d64dd144774853c3bb9b7ead133
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:12 26f7d09d2b41461598e03a9a420f5f7e
msgid ""
"Learn how to install the ROS onto a companion computer and run a sample ROS "
"2 application that communicated with ArduPilot over Micro XRCE DDS. For this"
" demonstation, a Raspberry Pi Zero 2W will be used, however other Linux "
"computers are also capable."
msgstr ""
"学习如何在伴飞计算机上安装 ROS，并运行一个通过 Micro XRCE DDS 与 ArduPilot 通信的 ROS 2 示例应用。本演示使用 "
"Raspberry Pi Zero 2W，但其他 Linux 计算机同样适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:16 3cdaf4328b8f40cbb88fe8a798a45f17
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:18 37d7a61af7024e609563f57fa630cce0
msgid ""
"`Raspberry Pi Zero 2W <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-"
"zero-2-w/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Raspberry Pi Zero 2W <https://www.raspberrypi.com/products/raspberry-pi-"
"zero-2-w/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:19 d74c9dc5fb3a4d28977fdeb0a0022656
msgid "A Linux computer to flash an SD card and configure the Pi"
msgstr "一台 Linux 计算机，用于烧录 SD 卡并配置 Pi"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:22 1c919f18fa4840e4a1ffd0c57c59866f
msgid "Initial Configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:24 98d55297b298470392e84025ed7366ae
msgid ""
"For the first section, we will follow `Ubuntu's tutorial "
"<https://ubuntu.com/tutorials/how-to-install-ubuntu-on-your-raspberry-"
"pi#1-overview>`__ , with specifics noted below."
msgstr ""
"在第一部分，我们将遵循 `Ubuntu 的教程 <https://ubuntu.com/tutorials/how-to-install-ubuntu-"
"on-your-raspberry-pi#1-overview>`__，以下会列出具体细节。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:26 81d7416b24504e3aba2130be98626b01
msgid "Use ``rpi-imager``."
msgstr "使用 ``rpi-imager``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:28 ac8b87e8c2084fc58e9ce22bb6d4e55a
msgid ""
"When selecting the operating system, we will install Ubuntu 22 Server. Find "
"it in \"Other general-purpose OS -> Ubuntu -> Ubuntu Server 22.04.5 LTS "
"(64-bit) which is supported by `ROS 2 humble "
"<https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-2000.html#humble-hawksbill-"
"may-2022-may-2027>`__. When prompted to do \"OS Customisation\", select "
"that."
msgstr ""
"选择操作系统时，安装 Ubuntu 22 Server。在「Other general-purpose OS -> Ubuntu -> Ubuntu "
"Server 22.04.5 LTS (64-bit)」中找到它，该版本受 `ROS 2 Humble "
"<https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-2000.html#humble-hawksbill-"
"may-2022-may-2027>`__ 支持。当提示进行「OS Customisation」时，选择该选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:33 600535e31c1d418f9b36c65a5c01bca6
msgid "In \"General\", Configure wireless LAN"
msgstr "在「General」中配置无线局域网"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:34 b9490cb224734a148cb5bdd4888c64c6
msgid "In \"Services\", enable SSH"
msgstr "在「Services」中启用 SSH"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:35 502480ac3e52401a9fa017b173e6a4d9
msgid "Save and flash the image onto the device"
msgstr "保存并将镜像烧录到设备"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:37 aa8f093ac73a4b87acc2435973591572
msgid ""
"Install the SD card, let it boot for 2 minutes, then either through a HDMI "
"display and keyboard, or by plugging the Pi's SD card back into your "
"computer, edit the file: ``/etc/avahi/avahi-daemon.conf`` and change the "
"line that has ``publish-workstation`` to ``publish-workstation=yes``."
msgstr ""
"插入 SD 卡，等待启动约 2 分钟，然后通过 HDMI 显示器和键盘，或将 Pi 的 SD 卡重新插入计算机，编辑文件 "
"``/etc/avahi/avahi-daemon.conf``，将包含 ``publish-workstation`` 的行改为 ``publish-"
"workstation=yes``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:40 69265a504f6a4e98aab194876987bfbd
msgid ""
"Now, put the SD card back into the Pi, boot it up with the USB, and you can "
"now connect."
msgstr "现在，将 SD 卡放回 Pi，通过 USB 启动，即可进行连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:50 bdb40e43865241e9b8a6c9a225975b6d
msgid ""
"Once you SSH, create your username and password, and test you can still "
"login, it's time to set up ROS 2. We'll install all the packages before it's"
" wired into the drone."
msgstr "通过 SSH 连接后，创建用户名和密码，验证可以正常登录，然后开始设置 ROS 2。我们将在接线到无人机之前安装所有软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:54 1ae5dbd795234599afe8e36004303e77
msgid "ROS 2 Install"
msgstr "安装 ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:56 a6698d5e867c4971aa682bf0f4696461
msgid ""
"When using Ubuntu 22.04, it's easiest to install ROS 2 through `binaries "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation/Ubuntu-Install-Debs.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"在使用 Ubuntu 22.04 时，通过 `二进制包 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Installation/Ubuntu-Install-Debs.html>`_ 安装 "
"ROS 2 最为方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:59 c12c4ab55ea6456dacb7ce96dbdf01e2
msgid ""
"First off, if you can't use ``apt update`` due to \"Waiting for cache lock: "
"Could not get lock /var/lib/dpkg/lock-frontend. It is held by process 912 "
"(unattended-upgr)\", try removing unattended upgrades"
msgstr ""
"首先，如果由于「Waiting for cache lock: Could not get lock /var/lib/dpkg/lock-"
"frontend. It is held by process 912 (unattended-upgr)」无法使用 ``apt "
"update``，请尝试删除自动升级包"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:67 857bf1635a714e4ea34e229c758986cc
msgid ""
"When installing ROS 2, install ``ros-humble-ros-base`` and ``ros-dev-"
"tools``."
msgstr "安装 ROS 2 时，安装 ``ros-humble-ros-base`` 和 ``ros-dev-tools``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:69 bc3f0ebb196041b0a2c74e7adc455423
msgid ""
"Finally, source the ROS environment automatically by adding it to your "
"``.bashrc``:"
msgstr "最后，通过将其添加到 ``.bashrc`` 来自动激活 ROS 环境："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:78 a123d65120464bcda766a4349f2907e6
msgid "Finally, check you have the ROS 2 CLI:"
msgstr "最后，验证 ROS 2 CLI 可用："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:85 988639f1f31241ecbed4db6767dc9002
msgid "Serial Connection"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:87 0a5aab17586b487aa5e376b7bfbb2adf
msgid ""
"Now, wire a serial connection to your flight controller. Ensure your power "
"supply is capable of powering the Pi Zero 2W. The simplest solution is to "
"wire an open telemetry port."
msgstr "现在，将串口连接到飞控。确保电源能够为 Pi Zero 2W 供电。最简单的方案是连接一个空闲的数传端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:92 a82983837f424d54b61a686ca11f5272
msgid ""
"Do not abuse the power supply for the flight controller. For robust "
"applications, it is recommended to power non-flight-critical devices, such "
"as a Raspberry Pi, with a separate 5V power supply. Although many flight "
"controller power supplies may support the power draw of a Raspberry Pi Zero "
"2W, a problem on the PI can bring down the entire vehicle."
msgstr ""
"不要过度使用飞控的电源。对于可靠性要求高的应用，建议为非飞行关键设备（如 Raspberry Pi）使用独立的 5V 电源。虽然许多飞控电源可能能够为 "
"Raspberry Pi Zero 2W 供电，但 Pi 出现问题可能导致整机失控。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:104 bd64e64b74ea4c77bb96d672201a6708
msgid ""
"This allow GPIO14 and GPIO15 (/dev/ttySO) to communicate with ArduPilot."
msgstr "这允许 GPIO14 和 GPIO15（/dev/ttySO）与 ArduPilot 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:107 25cfd3e564434617992845c42d25d344
msgid "Cross Compile an application with Docker"
msgstr "使用 Docker 交叉编译应用程序"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:112 8bf527b2d6a943dea84eda5985673d0b
msgid ""
"In order to run applications on a Raspberry Pi, we can cross compile them "
"for the ARM architecture. `Docker <https://www.docker.com/>`_ allows an easy"
" way to cross compile. Because of the Pi's limited memory, it is not "
"recommended to attempt compiling on target hardware. If you have a more "
"powerful computer, see the next section for direct compilation on ARM64."
msgstr ""
"为了在 Raspberry Pi 上运行应用程序，我们可以针对 ARM 架构进行交叉编译。`Docker "
"<https://www.docker.com/>`_ 提供了一种便捷的交叉编译方式。由于 Pi "
"的内存有限，不建议在目标硬件上直接编译。如果您有更强大的计算机，请参阅下一节了解在 ARM64 上直接编译的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:117 23ed5d5d641d4e73a5b633cb8f752b0a
msgid ""
"First, create a dockerfile like so on your laptop called ``Dockerfile``"
msgstr "首先，在您的笔记本电脑上创建名为 ``Dockerfile`` 的文件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:140 7f4cd9763c6848c3901abe42b5a8f7bb
msgid ""
"Next, use Docker's multi-platform build support to set up a cross compile in"
" an ARM64v8 environment: https://docs.docker.com/build/building/multi-"
"platform/#install-qemu-manually"
msgstr ""
"接下来，使用 Docker 的多平台构建支持在 ARM64v8 "
"环境中设置交叉编译：https://docs.docker.com/build/building/multi-platform/#install-"
"qemu-manually"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:147 89d7feba8cfa49a19699dfcef33f0d26
msgid ""
"Now, the following steps build the docker image and copy the ROS 2 install "
"directory to the target."
msgstr "现在，通过以下步骤构建 Docker 镜像并将 ROS 2 安装目录复制到目标设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:164 33c42701f2f447969c4c64a3de0ce649
msgid "Installing Dependencies"
msgstr "安装依赖项"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:166 41459f5779574e95bbd39e0e5982550a
msgid ""
"Although we have copied the executable(s) over, the runtime dependencies are"
" not installed. Let's use rosdep to install those. The target only needs "
"runtime dependencies, which are denoted with tag ``exec``."
msgstr ""
"尽管我们已将可执行文件复制过去，但运行时依赖项尚未安装。我们使用 rosdep 安装这些依赖项。目标设备只需要运行时依赖项，以标签 ``exec`` "
"标识。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:170 780c9d9b37a34aca8c3c89283bd2c96e
msgid "After SSH'ing into the target, run:"
msgstr "SSH 连接到目标设备后，运行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:181 d38b7f98965342508ace7f11621d6689
msgid "Compiling the Micro ROS agent directly on ARM64"
msgstr "在 ARM64 上直接编译 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:183 e0ab9d804a1d473781e13bbb5242d85a
msgid ""
"Instead of cross compiling, some more powerful companion computers can "
"support local compilation."
msgstr "对于性能较强的伴飞计算机，可以不进行交叉编译，而是在本地直接编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:187 92d6b6bf6ade4b758dc94206df342cef
msgid "Instructions coming soon"
msgstr "说明即将发布"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:190 027949b1a8a44846b52499b075af80d4
msgid "Test the Micro ROS Agent"
msgstr "测试 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:192 c202908301574e989fe6d5dff9060e2b
msgid ""
"Now that you have a cross-compiled installation of the Micro ROS Agent along"
" with its dependencies, let's check we can run it."
msgstr "现在您已经交叉编译并安装了 Micro ROS Agent 及其依赖项，让我们验证是否可以运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:200 54301cdf975a4f4fa53b30c65cc30d8f
msgid "Starting the Micro ROS Agent automatically"
msgstr "自动启动 Micro ROS Agent"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:202 80b28822525f4356877da6f1f19f9113
msgid ""
"Rather than having to SSH into the companion computer and manually start all"
" ROS 2 nodes in terminal, let's use systemd to start the service "
"automatically on boot. For this tutorial, we will use systemd user services "
"because they do not require root to run."
msgstr ""
"与其每次通过 SSH 连接伴飞计算机并手动在终端启动所有 ROS 2 节点，不如使用 systemd 在启动时自动启动服务。本教程使用 systemd "
"用户服务，因为它们不需要 root 权限运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:206 63d553bec10848c78fb3dda1126ac40d
msgid ""
"First, create a script on the companion computer that sources the ROS 2 "
"workspace and runs the Micro ROS Agent."
msgstr "首先，在伴飞计算机上创建一个脚本，用于激活 ROS 2 工作空间并运行 Micro ROS Agent。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:213 e22c4642759b46eebc355d0fda5e02ed
msgid "Place the following contents inside:"
msgstr "将以下内容写入文件："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:235 ed5d76211c544be9b2438724b1d0e0bd
msgid ""
"If you are not using ``ubuntu`` as your username, be sure to change the "
"``WorkingDirectory`` and ``ExecStart`` fields above!"
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的用户名不是 ``ubuntu``，请务必修改上面的 ``WorkingDirectory`` 和 ``ExecStart`` 字段！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:237 94e9125ab6674452834077173a0ba55d
msgid "Also, create the start script:"
msgstr "同时，创建启动脚本："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:244 5cd8fb54c48b48d88612f39c0d463b0d
msgid "And, place the following script inside:"
msgstr "并将以下脚本内容写入文件："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:253 49e22817a472425ab16e1063aa967cb8
msgid ""
"Finally, make it executable, reload services, and start the new Micro ROS "
"Agent systemd service."
msgstr "最后，赋予可执行权限，重新加载服务，并启动新的 Micro ROS Agent systemd 服务。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:263 d109c216e2ed4b14a6edf425701a6abf
msgid ""
"The MicroROS agent should show it has started. It is now waiting on a "
"connection from the autopilot. Once the autopilot is configured for the same"
" baud rate as the Micro ROS Agent, it should connect."
msgstr "MicroROS Agent 应显示已启动，并等待飞控连接。一旦飞控配置了与 Micro ROS Agent 相同的波特率，即可建立连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:266 1c2154ec3b9240dbb6b940cd9b8b8de6
msgid ""
"Because systemctl user services won't start until someone logs in, enable "
"linger for login."
msgstr "由于 systemctl 用户服务在有人登录之前不会启动，请为登录启用 linger。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:272 e158c2d6b268418abcec194ff87aab90
msgid "Once you start adding more service, you can check status like so:"
msgstr "添加更多服务后，可以通过以下方式检查状态："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-pi.rst:278 4e77e3bbf815415aa1e02069638e82b3
msgid "Now, reboot, and verify your systemd service is up."
msgstr "现在，重启设备，验证 systemd 服务是否正常运行。"

